id: SECRETS-038
title: Adyen API Key
category: secrets
severity: error
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .ts .tsx .js .jsx .py .java .go .rb .rs .cpp .h .cs .php .env .yml .yaml .json .toml .xml .properties .cfg .ini .conf .sh .tf .hcl
  exclude_paths: test/ vendor/ node_modules/ .git/ build/ dist/ __pycache__/ .venv/ target/
  content_contains: adyen
patterns:
  - regex: AQE[a-z0-9]{5,}\.[A-Za-z0-9_-]{30,}
    message: Adyen API key detected. This grants access to live payment processing infrastructure.
fix: Generate a new API key in Adyen Customer Area > Developers > API credentials. Store the key in a secrets manager with strict access controls.
